      "html": "<div class=\"sentinel-root bg-[hsl(var(--hero-bg))] min-h-screen\" style=\"font-family:'Sora',sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;\" data-kid=\"0\">\n  <style data-kid=\"1\">\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap');\n\n    .sentinel-root {\n      --background: 0 0% 10%;\n      --foreground: 0 0% 96%;\n      --primary: 119 99% 46%;\n      --primary-foreground: 0 0% 4%;\n      --secondary: 0 0% 18%;\n      --muted: 0 0% 16%;\n      --muted-foreground: 0 0% 60%;\n      --accent: 119 99% 46%;\n      --border: 0 0% 20%;\n      --ring: 119 99% 46%;\n      --radius: 0.5rem;\n      --nav-button: 0 0% 18%;\n      --hero-bg: 0 0% 8%;\n    }\n\n    @keyframes fade-up {\n      0% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); filter: blur(4px); }\n      100% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); filter: blur(0); }\n    }\n    @keyframes fade-in {\n      0% { opacity: 0; }\n      100% { opacity: 1; }\n    }\n    .animate-fade-up {\n      opacity: 0;\n      animation: fade-up 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;\n    }\n    .animate-fade-in {\n      opacity: 0;\n      animation: fade-in 0.5s ease-out forwards;\n    }\n  </style>\n\n  <script type=\"module\" src=\"https://unpkg.com/@splinetool/viewer@1.9.82/build/spline-viewer.js\" data-kid=\"2\"></script>\n\n  \n  <nav class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 flex justify-between items-center px-8 lg:px-16 py-5\" data-kid=\"3\">\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-[hsl(var(--foreground))] text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight\" data-kid=\"4\">SENTINEL</a>\n    <div class=\"hidden md:flex gap-8\" data-kid=\"5\">\n      <a href=\"#services\" class=\"text-sm text-[hsl(var(--muted-foreground))] hover:text-[hsl(var(--foreground))] transition-colors uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"6\">Services</a>\n      <a href=\"#about-us\" class=\"text-sm text-[hsl(var(--muted-foreground))] hover:text-[hsl(var(--foreground))] transition-colors uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"7\">About Us</a>\n      <a href=\"#projects\" class=\"text-sm text-[hsl(var(--muted-foreground))] hover:text-[hsl(var(--foreground))] transition-colors uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"8\">Projects</a>\n      <a href=\"#team\" class=\"text-sm text-[hsl(var(--muted-foreground))] hover:text-[hsl(var(--foreground))] transition-colors uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"9\">Team</a>\n      <a href=\"#contacts\" class=\"text-sm text-[hsl(var(--muted-foreground))] hover:text-[hsl(var(--foreground))] transition-colors uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"10\">Contacts</a>\n    </div>\n    <button class=\"hidden md:inline-flex items-center rounded-lg uppercase text-xs tracking-widest px-6 h-11 bg-[hsl(var(--nav-button))] text-[hsl(var(--foreground))] hover:bg-[hsl(var(--nav-button))]/80 active:scale-[0.97] transition-all cursor-pointer\" data-kid=\"11\">Get Quote</button>\n  </nav>\n\n  \n  <section class=\"relative min-h-screen flex items-end bg-[hsl(var(--hero-bg))] overflow-hidden\" data-kid=\"12\">\n    \n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0\" data-kid=\"13\">\n      <spline-viewer url=\"https://prod.spline.design/Slk6b8kz3LRlKiyk/scene.splinecode\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%\" data-kid=\"14\"></spline-viewer>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/30 z-[1] pointer-events-none\" data-kid=\"15\"></div>\n\n    \n    <div class=\"relative z-10 pointer-events-none w-full max-w-[90%] sm:max-w-md lg:max-w-2xl px-6 md:px-10 pb-10 pt-32\" data-kid=\"16\">\n      <h1 class=\"animate-fade-up text-[clamp(3rem,8vw,6rem)] font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.05em] text-[hsl(var(--foreground))] mb-2 md:mb-4 uppercase\" style=\"animation-delay:0.2s\" data-kid=\"17\">SENTINEL<span class=\"text-[hsl(var(--primary))]\" data-kid=\"18\"> AI</span></h1>\n      <p class=\"animate-fade-up text-[hsl(0_0%_96%/0.8)] text-[clamp(1.125rem,2.5vw,1.875rem)] font-light mb-3 md:mb-6\" style=\"animation-delay:0.4s\" data-kid=\"19\">We implement security correctly.</p>\n      <p class=\"animate-fade-up text-[hsl(var(--muted-foreground))] text-[clamp(0.875rem,1.5vw,1.25rem)] font-light mb-4 md:mb-8\" style=\"animation-delay:0.55s\" data-kid=\"20\">Enterprise security systems built in days. AI-powered surveillance deployed with zero-trust architecture. Smart access control set up for your entire facility. All of it done right, not just fast.</p>\n      <div class=\"animate-fade-up flex flex-wrap gap-3 font-bold\" style=\"animation-delay:0.7s\" data-kid=\"21\">\n        <button class=\"pointer-events-auto bg-[hsl(var(--primary))] text-[hsl(var(--primary-foreground))] px-6 py-3 md:px-8 md:py-4 text-sm rounded-sm cursor-pointer hover:brightness-110 transition-all active:scale-[0.97]\" data-kid=\"22\">Book a Call</button>\n        <button class=\"pointer-events-auto bg-white text-[hsl(var(--background))] px-6 py-3 md:px-8 md:py-4 text-sm rounded-sm cursor-pointer hover:brightness-90 transition-all active:scale-[0.97]\" data-kid=\"23\">Our Work</button>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"animate-fade-up text-[hsl(0_0%_60%/0.6)] text-xs font-light mt-4 md:mt-6\" style=\"animation-delay:0.85s\" data-kid=\"24\">Trusted security partner. Columbus, OH. 12 systems deployed.</p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>",
